  "notes": "### macOS Universal 2.3.8\n\nFor Intel and Apple silicon Macs running macOS 14.4 or later.\n\n- **Image Editor controls** · Enter coordinates, dimensions, angles, and opacity in wider numeric fields without stepper arrows.\n- **On-canvas text** · Click the image and type. Change font size during the edit and resize committed text with the layer handles. Press Command-Return to commit or Esc to cancel. Command-Z and Shift-Command-Z undo and redo committed edits.\n- **Excel workbooks in Reference** · Open .xlsx files in an offline, read-only grid. Switch worksheets, select and copy cells, and view saved formula results. Formulas without saved results show “Result unavailable.”\n- **PDF Reference** · The document arrows, continuous page scrolling, and annotation undo and redo remain available.\n\nBuilt and tested on an Intel Mac Pro. The app is signed ad hoc. Every bundled Mach-O file contains x86_64 and arm64 slices. The arm64 slices were checked structurally.\n\nSource commit: `e3f9398ed9c608116ce843aa75d1c6021eefcb3b`. The corresponding source archive, third-party notices and source references, and SHA-256 checksums accompany the DMG.\n",
